Recommendations for domain name
A domain name in the «.by» domain zone must contain at least two and no more than sixty-three letters of the Latin alphabet, numbers, characters «hyphen» («-«), must not begin, end with the character «hyphen» («-»), and also contain a hyphen («-») in the third and fourth positions at the same time.
A domain name in the «.bel» domain zone is formulated using letters of the Belarusian or Russian alphabet, numbers, characters «hyphen» («-») and «apostrophe» («’») which when translated into Latin transliteration contains not less than two and not more than sixty-three letters, numbers, characters, and must not begin or end with the characters «hyphen» («-») and (or) "apostrophe" («’»).
Domain names containing words or phrases that do not meet generally accepted moral and ethical standards, incite the ethnic hatred, promote violence, cruelty and other acts prohibited by the legislation of the Republic of Belarus are not subject to registration.
